    notes = {"The majority of enemies in Fei'Yin detect by sound, however there are several that detect spellcasting.", "Quick Travel options:", "Home Point #1 to Fei'Yin is the fastest way, it puts you right at the zone to Qu'Bia Arena.", "Unity Warp (Level 128) will place you at the entrance of Fei'Yin.", "Unity Warp (Level 125) will place you in the central area of Beaucedine Glacier.", "From the entrance of Fei'Yin go east to (K-8). There are 2 Dolls in front of a door named Cermet Portal, open it and you'll be able to enter Qu'Bia Arena."},
