    instruction = "Escort Quasilumin NPCs through the palace. Find the nearby Cermet Alcove for each blocked gate, start the Quasilumin, protect it, and check it again at its destination to open the next gate. Complete route: Map 1 upper (J-8) escort with 5-minute limit, Map 1 (L-7) transporter, Map 2 basement (L-8) escort, Map 2 (I-10) escort, Map 2 (G-12) transporter, Map 1 (G-10) escort with 40-minute limit, Map 1 (G-4) transporter, then continue to Map 2 (H-8). Expect shapeshifting Ix'ghrah, Eo'ghrah, and Eo'zdei at escort endpoints.",
